 ones and call this before then. Text","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"holding anything else, a list that doesn’t parse, or a CA’s list","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"older than the one held (a lower CRL number, or an earlier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"thisUpdate) throws ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalidInput"},{"text":" and keeps the lists as they were,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so a replayed list can’t un-revoke a certificate; empty text","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"removes them all, and a role checked then fails closed. Makes no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"network calls.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/s8SendableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/s8SendableP","title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/PresentingInPerson":{"kind":"article","title":"Presenting in person","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/PresentingInPerson","role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Share an mdoc with a reader nearby over Bluetooth, or be the reader,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with ISO\/IEC 18013-5 device retrieval."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/presentinginperson","type":"topic"}}}